Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 10:18:05 +0200
Subject: [M150] [compiler] Ensure dictionary load fast-path only target
 JSObjects

Original change's description:
> [compiler] Ensure dictionary load fast-path only target JSObjects
>
> AccessInfoFactory::ComputePropertyAccessInfo previously returned a
> DictionaryDataField for any receiver map with is_dictionary_map() set.
> This assumption is invalid for JSProxy objects as all non-callable proxies
> share the context-wide proxy_map, but their properties_or_hash_ field
> may hold a raw Smi identity hash rather than a NameDictionary.
>
> This CL restricts the dictionary load fast-path to genuine JSObject
> maps (excluding global objects, access checks, and interceptors).
>
> Fixed: 541251902
> Change-Id: Ic2077e96c152091139c72447b6aa351e52497c43
